# No Git-LFS: the upstream repo's LFS quota exhaustion caused pointer-stub failures.
# Large binaries (.pth/.hdf5/USD zips) are gitignored and restored via
# JCIIOT/pipeline/fetch_assets.ps1 (sha256-verified downloads from the official repo).
* text=auto
*.json text
*.md text
*.py text
*.ps1 text
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
